150
00:12:33,794 --> 00:12:35,921
Anjing peliharaan Pak Matthew
tak ada di sini.

151
00:12:36,547 --> 00:12:37,715
Apa A-ji juga mati?

152
00:12:38,466 --> 00:12:39,925
